    If the error's bucket and service account are confirmed to be the correct ones, grant the deployment service account access to the staging bucket. For example, using Cloud Shell or another Bash-compatible terminal:
    
    gcloud storage buckets add-iam-policy-binding \
      gs://staging.workspace-prod-511311.appspot.com \
      --member="serviceAccount:service-app-engine-demo@workspace-prod-511311.iam.gserviceaccount.com" \
